---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site.config.js';
---

<Page
  title="Terms of use"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  lede={`The terms on which ${SITE.name} is made available.`}
  updated="29 August 2026"
>
  <p>By using this site you accept these terms. If you do not accept them, please do not use the site.</p>

  <h2>What we provide</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} publishes reference profiles compiled from publicly available sources. The site is provided for
    information. It is not advice — not legal, financial, educational, admissions, employment or investment advice —
    and should not be relied on as the sole basis for a decision about any entity described here.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We take care to cite sources accurately and to check them before publication, and we correct errors when they are
    documented to us. We do not warrant that the site is complete, current or error-free. Public records change,
    sources are revised, and external pages move or disappear. Where a claim is unverified we say so on the profile.
  </p>

  <h2>Your use of the site</h2>
  <p>You may read, link to, quote and cite this site freely. You may not:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>scrape or bulk-copy the site in a way that burdens the service or republishes profiles wholesale;</li>
    <li>use the content to train a model that reproduces the profiles as its own output without attribution;</li>
    <li>present our material as your own, or strip attribution and source labelling from it;</li>
    <li>use the site to harass any person profiled here;</li>
    <li>attempt to breach, probe or disrupt the site's security.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The written profiles, page structure and design are © {SITE.founded}–{new Date().getFullYear()} {SITE.publisher}.
    Individual facts are not owned by us, and material quoted from cited sources remains the property of those
    sources; quotations are used in a limited, attributed way for reporting and comment. Names, logos and trade marks
    of entities described on this site belong to their owners, and their appearance here is descriptive, not an
    indication of any affiliation or endorsement.
  </p>
  <p>
    Short quotations with a link back are welcome. For substantial reuse, ask us:
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Profiles link to external sources so you can check our work. We do not control those sites and are not responsible
    for their content, availability or practices. A citation is a pointer to evidence, not an endorsement.
  </p>

  <h2>Subjects of profiles</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing here is intended to defame, disparage or misrepresent any person or organization. If you are the subject
    of a profile and believe it contains an error, see our <a href="/about/corrections/">corrections policy</a> — that
    route is faster and more effective than a legal letter, and we act on documented errors regardless of how they
    reach us.
  </p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.publisher} is not liable for any loss arising from use of, or
    reliance on, this site or any site linked from it. Nothing in these terms limits liability for death or personal
    injury caused by negligence, for fraud, or for anything else that cannot lawfully be excluded.
  </p>

  <h2>Availability</h2>
  <p>
    We may change, suspend, withdraw or update the site or any profile at any time, including removing content while
    it is under review.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    Updated terms are posted on this page with a new date. Continuing to use the site after that means you accept the
    revised terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
</Page>
